{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1587","published":"2026-03-15T11:10:35Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:40.310472007Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-26597"],"summary":"libX11 security update","details":"Core X11 protocol client library.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA buffer overflow flaw was found in X.Org and Xwayland. If XkbChangeTypesOfKey() is called with a 0 group, it will resize the key symbols table to 0 but leave the key actions unchanged. If the same function is later called with a non-zero value of groups, this will cause a buffer overflow because the key actions are of the wrong size.(CVE-2025-26597)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libX11","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/libX11&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libX11-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libX11-debuginfo-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libX11-debugsource-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libX11-devel-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["libX11-help-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["libX11-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["libX11-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libX11-debuginfo-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libX11-debugsource-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libX11-devel-1.6.9-9.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1587.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-1587"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-26597"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"High"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"}]}